### Public aggregate response
GET http://localhost:8085/api/profiles/alex/page

### Next cursor page
GET http://localhost:8085/api/profiles/alex/contents?cursor=3

### Owner view
GET http://localhost:8085/api/profiles/alex/page
Authorization: Basic alex demo-password

### Saved contents (private to Alex)
GET http://localhost:8085/api/profiles/alex/contents?saved=true
Authorization: Basic alex demo-password

### Read image through ObjectStorage
GET http://localhost:8085/api/auth/avatar/1

### Fetch CSRF token before writes. Keep the session cookie in the HTTP client.
GET http://localhost:8085/api/demo/csrf
Authorization: Basic alex demo-password

> {% client.global.set("csrf", response.body.token); %}

### Follow Jordan
POST http://localhost:8085/api/profiles/jordan/follow
Authorization: Basic alex demo-password
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"following": true}

### Undo follow
POST http://localhost:8085/api/profiles/jordan/follow
Authorization: Basic alex demo-password
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"following": false}
